  "operative_text": "Section 1 (Section 23-31-240): Section 23-31-240. Notwithstanding any other provision contained in this article, the following persons who possess a valid permit pursuant to this article may carry a concealable weapon anywhere within this State, when carrying out the duties of their office: (11) active solicitors and assistant solicitors, the Attorney General and assistant attorneys general; and"
}